@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
title Proposed local admission and independent post-commit paths
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

|Web / owner|
start
:Validate intent / authority\nand expected versions;
|Transactional store|
:Guard and commit state, result\nand required pending intent;
if (Commit confirmed?) then (yes)
 fork
  |Web / owner|
  :Return local result /\npending operation reference;
 fork again
  |Dispatcher / worker|
  :Discover committed intent;\natomically claim current scope;
  :Call scoped external adapter\noutside SQL transaction;
  :Record actual outcome / unknown effect\nand reconciliation need;
 end fork
 |Dispatcher / worker|
 :Scenario observation complete;\nunknown work remains durable;
else (failed / uncertain)
 |Web / owner|
 :Resolve actual command outcome;\nno dispatch from an uncommitted intent;
endif
stop
legend bottom
 Fork/join describes completion of this scenario view, not a web request waiting on a remote effect.
 Swimlanes are responsibilities, not one thread or mandatory server per lane.
endlegend
@enduml
